\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Real-trainer deadline ladder on non-IID CIFAR-10. Nominal and 0.1\,s: ten seeds; 0.05\,s: five seeds. Accuracy is the final-ten-round mean (rounds 30--39, the pre-fixed terminal window); timely-delivery ratio, bytes per round (rounds 30--39, attempted uplink), and mean delivered rank follow the definitions given in the setup. Rounded cells imply $0.49/0.41\approx 19.5\%$; the $+22\%$ headline is the ratio of unrounded seed means and the per-seed mean gain is $+23\%$ (\cref  {fig:stresspay}c). Per-seed s.d.: timely-delivery ratio $0.03$--$0.06$, MB at most $0.05$ (zero for fixed-rank policies); per-seed tables are in the public repository.}}{12}{table.85}\protected@file@percent }
